#. translators: %s: branch
#: includes/class-admin.php:785
#: includes/class-admin.php:798
#: includes/class-admin.php:824
#: includes/class-admin.php:836
#: includes/class-admin.php:838
#, php-format
msgid "%s now"
msgstr "今の %s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:870
msgid "HeimDB keeps every version of every row for the retention period. See what changed since a point in time, read a row as it was, restore the branch to that point (undoable), or branch off from it."
msgstr "HeimDB は、古い版を残す期間のあいだ、すべての行のすべての版を持っています。ある時点からの変更を見る、行の当時の値を読む、ブランチをその時点に戻す（取り消せます）、その時点からブランチを作る、ができます。"

